Title: "Any Of"
Id: "edfdd78d-0394-48c3-aa1b-f77d8ac9ab03"

Text: "`anyOf:` contains alternative clauses where at least one should hold.

```mlg-fragment
anyOf:
. P
. Q
```

The group may have an optional label heading. Nested clauses use the same clause syntax recursively."
Id: "fa1cb893-5d84-479f-b287-ee3a9a6fef32"
